            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to an article of footwear comprising: an upper including a knitted component forming a medial side and/or a lateral side of the upper; a sole structure; and at least one knitted containment piece secured to the sole structure and wrapping over at least a portion of the sole structure and at least a portion of the knitted component.</p>
